ne operand that is an unsigned 32-bit value that is extracted from the least significant 32 bits of the specified register. Other than that, these perform full XLEN operations.\n\nBitmanip instructions with the suffix _.b_ , _.h_ and _.w_ only look at the least significant 8-bits, 16-bits and 32-bits of the input (respectively) and produce an XLEN-wide result that is sign-extended or zeroextended, based on the specific instruction."},{"passage_id":"f5c169eadc294691593a6a7adaf752133ddb3808716c69b204e554e6ced2a4bb","section_path":"Table of Contents","source_id":"loongarch-vol1","text":"||\n|---|\n|2.2.2.4. SLLI.D, SRLI.D, SRAI.D, ROTRI.D. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 30|\n|2.2.3. Bit-manipulation Instructions . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 31|\n|2.2.3.1. EXT.W{B/H} . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 31|\n|2.2.3.2. CL{O/Z}.{W/D}, CT{O/Z}.{W/D} . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 31|\n|2.2.3.3. BYTEPICK.{W/D} . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 33|\n|2.2.3.4. REVB.{2H/4H/2W/D}. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 33|\n|2.2.3.5. REVH.{2W/D}. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 34|\n|2.2.3.6. BITREV.{4B/8B} . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 35|\n|2.2.3.7. BITREV.{W/D}. . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . . 36|"}],"query":{"id":"q045","intent":"Find a LoongArch instruction for 